			"vo": ["sheppard", "Students. The last round of the term. For eleven years I have known how this day ends. I would like, once, to be surprised."]},
		{"cup_table": {"title": "The Dorm Cup", "sub": "The table this morning", "mark": "red"}},
		{"s": "sheppard", "t": "The final round. Red against Blue, three duels, fifteen points to the dorm that takes two of them. Yellow has the bye.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "A formality. A pleasant one. I have had the Blue common room decorated since Thursday.", "do": "stomp", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sheppard", "t": "And this year the final has a voice. Mister Paz, of the Red dorm.", "do": "wave"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Good morning, Duel Academy! This is the Dorm Cup, this is the last round of the term, and I have been told this microphone was expensive!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "The young man with my card. He does fill a room.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "The man from the helicopter is here. He is not looking at the duelists. He is looking at the building.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		# ---- duel one: Jaden against Felix
		{"s": "nico", "t": "First duel! For Blue, a first-year who has already chosen his armchair: Felix Arden! For Red, the best duelist in our dorm, if somebody wakes him: Jaden Yuki!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "low"},
		{"move": "felix", "to": STAGE + Vector3(-1.9, 0, 4.9), "face": 1.57},
		{"move": "jaden", "to": STAGE + Vector3(2.4, 0, 4.9), "face": -1.57, "wait": true},
		{"s": "felix", "t": "Yuki. The prefect told me to make this quick.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Yeah? Cool. Me too. I did not get to finish my nap.", "emote": "...", "cam": "close"},
		{"clash": {"a": "jaden", "b": "felix", "lp": [4000, 4000], "win": "a", "beats": [
			["b", "ARCHFIEND SOLDIER", "Nineteen hundred attack on my first turn. Your move, Red.", 0],
			["a", "POLYMERIZATION", "Okay. Sparkman and Clayman, from my hand. I fuse them.", 0],
			["a", "ELEMENTAL HERO THUNDER GIANT", "Thunder Giant. I discard one card, and he destroys a monster weaker than he is. That one. Then he attacks you.", 2400],
			["b", "ARCHFIEND SOLDIER", "A second Soldier. In defense this time. You do not get through twice.", 0],
			["a", "ELEMENTAL HERO THUNDER GIANT", "Same trick. Sorry. It is the only one I am awake for.", 2400]]}},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Two turns! Red takes the first duel in two turns, and I am almost sure he yawned in the middle!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"move": "jaden", "to": STAGE + Vector3(-1.3, 0, 6.8), "face": "sheppard"},
		{"move": "felix", "to": STAGE + Vector3(6.9, 0, 3.2), "face": "sheppard", "wait": true},
		{"s": "felix", "t": "You gave me to him. On purpose. I was the one you could afford to lose.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "I was not going to spend Rhodes on Jaden Yuki. One duel given away. Two taken. That is the whole plan, Arden, and you played your part.", "cam": "low"},
		# ---- duel two: Syrus against Alexis
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Second duel! For Blue, second on the League list: Alexis Rhodes! For Red, the bravest person I know who is afraid of everything: Syrus Truesdale!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "low"},
		{"move": "alexis", "to": STAGE + Vector3(-1.9, 0, 4.9), "face": 1.57},
		{"move": "syrus", "to": STAGE + Vector3(2.4, 0, 4.9), "face": -1.57, "wait": true},
		{"s": "syrus", "t": "He is watching. He is right there. Okay. Okay. I have a plan.", "emote": "...", "cam": "close"},
		{"clash": {"a": "syrus", "b": "alexis", "lp": [4000, 4000], "win": "b", "beats": [
			["a", "GYROID", "Gyroid. In defense. He survives one battle every turn.", 0],
			["b", "ETOILE CYBER", "A good opening, Syrus. I mean that. Etoile Cyber, in attack.", 0],
			["a", "STEAMROID", "Steamroid! He gains five hundred when he attacks!", 1100],
			["b", "POLYMERIZATION", "You were ahead, and you looked at the stands. Blade Skater and a second Etoile Cyber, from my hand.", 0],
			["b", "CYBER BLADER", "Cyber Blader. While you control exactly two monsters, her attack is doubled. She attacks Steamroid.", 2900],
			["a", "CYCROID", "One more monster. If I have one more, I can... oh. Oh no. That is two again.", 0],
			["b", "CYBER BLADER", "Two again. I am sorry, Syrus. Truly.", 3400]]}},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Blue takes the second. One duel each. He was ahead. I want that written down somewhere. He was ahead.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "He was winning after two turns, Zane. You saw it.", "cam": "close"},
