		{"move": "alexis", "to": STAGE + Vector3(5.6, 0, 2.4), "face": "sheppard"},
		{"move": "syrus", "to": STAGE + Vector3(-0.9, 0, 8.5), "face": "sheppard", "wait": true},
		{"s": "syrus", "t": "He did not look away. Not once. I think that is worse.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		# ---- duel three: you
		{"s": "nico", "t": "One each! It comes down to the last duel of the term! For Blue: the prefect, the president of the Student Council, three wins out of three on Monday. Octavia Lenz!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "low"},
		{"move": "octavia", "to": STAGE + Vector3(-1.9, 0, 4.9), "face": "player", "wait": true},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And for Red. Last off the ferry. Reserve of the League team. From Room Two, and I am not going to pretend I am neutral about it!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "I asked for you by name. I want that understood. Not because you are the easy draw. Because you are sitting in the seat I did not get.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "My deck says no. To your Spells, to your Traps, to your monsters. I have never been behind in a duel, because I have never allowed the turn that puts me there.", "cam": "low", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Then today you find out what you do there."},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "The Professor said the same thing. I would like to see one of you prove it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "Do not win it for me. Do not win it for eleven years. Win it because it is Saturday and she is in front of you.", "cam": "low"},
