		{"s": "jaden", "t": "People think I do not care about winning. I care about this. The part after, when everybody is still here.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You slept through your semifinal.", "if": "m_fest_jaden"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Yeah. And I woke up to a skewer and a sky full of these. I think I won that one.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "emote": "♪"},
