		{"shot": {"on": FERRY + Vector3(0, 0, 0), "look_h": 2.0, "ang": [0.5, 0.9], "d": [34.0, 26.0], "h": [9.0, 6.0], "t": 6.5},
			"vo": ["nico", "The team crosses at dawn. The sea is calm. The voice of the League is not. The voice of the League would like the horizon to hold still."]},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "He grips the rail. He is fine. He is narrating this so that he does not have to think about breakfast.", "do": "scratch", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "You did not have to come, Nico. The Sun has its own announcer."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "They have a man with a microphone. That is not the same thing. I have a plan. I am not saying it out loud. The sea is listening.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "His plan has four steps. He has told me three. I have a figure for the fourth and I am keeping it to myself.", "if": "m_train_mika", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "...It is a good plan.", "if": "m_train_mika", "do": "scratch", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "bastion", "t": "The Academy of the Sun. Fast attack, direct damage, and eleven thousand people who behave like a Field Spell. The file is ninety pages.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "bastion", "t": "I have prepared a short version for the crossing. It is sixty.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Is there a six-page version?"},
		{"s": "bastion", "t": "There is not. ...There will be one by the harbor. I resent it already.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "Second seat, away, in front of a crowd. I stood in the plaza at noon eleven times this week to practice noise. It helps by about a third.", "if": "m_train_mika"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "I have read the Sun's home rules. The stands may shout anything except card names. I am told they shout card names.", "if": "m_train_octavia", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "syrus", "t": "My brother is on this boat. Tomorrow my brother watches me play. I have counted the lifeboats. There are four.", "if": "m_train_syrus", "do": "scratch", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Look at the far rail. He has not turned a card over since the pier.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"move": "sato", "to": FERRY + Vector3(2.4, 0, 7.4), "face": "zane", "wait": true},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "You sit tomorrow.", "cam": "low"},
		{"wait": 1.6},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "I need to see this team without you while I can still fix it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"wait": 1.2},
		{"s": "zane", "t": "...Understood.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "I am not calling that. Nobody is calling that.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "He said it like a word in another language.", "cam": "close"},
		{"move": "sato", "to": FERRY + Vector3(1.8, 0, 6.2), "face": "player", "wait": true},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "The order for tomorrow. Rhodes opens. Our newest seat plays second. The decider is yours.", "cam": "low", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "And the captain?", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "The captain watches from the bench. It is the best seat in the building. He has never tried it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "Three years on this team. I have never once seen him sit down during a match.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"merits": 20, "why": "The ferry to the mainland"},
