		{"s": "sato", "t": "Nobody was at the table when I came home.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "So I gave the seat back, and I came here. To the dorm that taught me to eat with other people.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "And him?", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Before I sailed I asked him to come. As my second. A professional may bring one person into her corner. I wanted him in mine.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "He leaves that part out. He heard charity. It was the opposite.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "I was not handing him a seat. I was telling him I could not do it without him. He only ever heard the first sentence.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "So he built a school. The best decks, the best coaches, a scholarship in every pocket. To prove that talent is bought.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Because if it is made, then he threw away ten years being angry at a friend.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "He offered you a scholarship because he cannot bear that anybody might turn one down. You did. Now he has to watch what happens next.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "She is not angry. I keep checking. It would be easier to listen to if she were.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "One more thing, and then you may eat. There is a cellar on this island with both our names on a wall. Not our real ones.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "If you have been down there, you have read them. If you have not, it is still a good wall.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
