			"chapter": "Chapter 25", "title": "The Prodigy", "sub": "Rank four. Every newcomer who gets onto the Ladder plays him next. Most of them once."},
		{"campus": {"morning": true, "weekday": 5}},
		{"cine": true},
		{"room": STADIUM, "r": 10.0},
