		{"actor": "lumen", "at": STADIUM + Vector3(1.8, 0, 3.8), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You studied him all week. Alone, on the rug. Bastion would have had a file. You had a rug.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "A rug has more room than a file."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "A rug does not answer when you ask it things. I know. I asked it. On Wednesday. At four in the morning.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "And look at him. He is not warming up. Everybody else on that Ladder warmed up. He is just standing there being sure.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "leo", "t": "Island! Behind you! The sign is sideways this week! That is progress! I measured!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"s": "leo", "t": "I asked to sit in your corner. They said a fan is not a second. I asked twice. They said it slower.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "official", "t": "Rank four. Aster. This office calls the match the Gate. Eleven newcomers have reached it in four years. One went through.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "official", "t": "One duel. No second is registered for the challenger. I am required to read that part aloud.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "You again. I watched the recording eleven times. I know what I did wrong. You will not get it twice.", "if": "aster_exhibition_won", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "The bench. They gave the bench a direct seat. I did tell them to send me the recording.", "unless": "aster_exhibition_won", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "On your island I had a school crowd, a sponsor in the front row and a captain to embarrass. I played to the room.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "Today there is no room. There is rank four, and there is whoever wants it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "I want it."},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "Naturally. So did the other eleven. Let me look at what you brought.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "I asked the office who trains you. They said: a professor, on an island. I asked who trains you here. They had no line for that.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "She is forty minutes away."},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "Forty minutes is longer than this duel.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "Your corner. Bench: one. People: none. A paper bag. One fan with a crooked sign. That is not a team. That is weather.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "It is the rice again. He packed it again. Do not let him talk about the bag.", "emote": "!"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "On your island you had a captain to hide behind and a kitchen to go home to. Look around. Here you have no team.", "cam": "low", "do": "chat"},
		{"wait": 1.2},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "And what am I?", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"cine": false},
		{"choice": [["I am not here alone.", "m_ch25_said"], ["(Look at her. Then at him.)", "m_ch25_look"]]},
		{"cine": true},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "I count one. But you say it as if you believed it. Fine. Bring whoever it is.", "if": "m_ch25_said", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Out loud. In front of a professional. You are going to look so strange on the recording. Thank you.", "if": "m_ch25_said", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "leo", "t": "I heard that! I do not know what I heard! I am clapping anyway!", "if": "m_ch25_said", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "That will do. For now.", "if": "m_ch25_look", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "You are staring at an empty piece of floor. I have seen newcomers pray before a duel. It has never once worked on me.", "if": "m_ch25_look", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "aster", "t": "They call me the Gate because I need nobody to help me hold it. Come and push.", "cam": "low", "do": "stomp"},
