		# ---- the ferry home
		{"scene": {"district": "academy", "inside": "", "pos": FERRY + Vector3(-1.2, 0, 1.9), "yaw": 0.9, "tod": "sunset", "music": "shop"},
			"title": "The Ferry Home", "sub": "Sunset. An empty deck, you, and a light nobody else can see."},
		{"actor": "lumen", "at": FERRY + Vector3(-3.1, 0, 2.4), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Forty minutes. Nobody else on the deck. Last week I liked that.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "The machine by the stairs sold you a sandwich. That is the only conversation you have had since the stadium.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Can I ask you something? It is not about the duel."},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Ask."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "On the island you had Nico, and Mika, and a kitchen. I was the extra one. The one on your shoulder who made the jokes.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Out here it is only me. And today I got bigger. I felt it happen. It was the best thing I have ever felt.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I used to fit on your shoulder. Tonight I had to duck to get through the ferry door. I did not have to. I ducked for the fun of it.", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "And then I thought about the kitchen. About how loud it is. About how nobody in it can hear me.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "So what happens to me when you have people again?", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"wait": 1.4},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You were on the boat before any of them. First one."},
		{"s": "player", "t": "They are the team. You are the one who saw all of it. That seat is not open.", "cam": "close"},
		{"wait": 1.0},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "...That was not the question.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "The question was about the rice. Whether you are ever going to eat the rice. Obviously.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I heard the answer, though. In case you were wondering whether I heard it.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You said you were not alone, out loud, to a man who has never had a corner. I am keeping that one.", "if": "m_ch25_said", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You did not say a word to him. You only looked at me. Nobody has ever answered a professional with me before.", "if": "m_ch25_look", "cam": "close"},
