		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Rank four. Two names left on the Ladder. Then whoever wins the long road. Then her.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Rank three has been rank three for eleven years. She is not in a hurry. You are. That is the part that worries me.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You have the decks out again. Rank three on the left, rank two on the right, and the middle pile is everything that could go wrong."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "On the island that was three people's work. I remember. One of them brought snacks.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "The man with the sheet is right about the box. I hate the box. But a line can be rubbed out. I looked at it very closely.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "One more hour."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You said that on Tuesday. It was a very long hour. It had a sunrise in it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Lie down, at least. I will count the cards for you. I will count them slowly. It is the most boring thing I know how to do.", "cam": "close", "do": "chat"},
