		{"s": "lumen", "t": "The floor is empty. Everybody went to eat. Almost everybody. By the ticket desk.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"move": "crane", "to": STADIUM + Vector3(0.2, 0, 2.4), "face": "player", "wait": true},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "Forgive me. I did not want to do this in front of the cameras. You look tired, and nobody should be photographed tired.", "cam": "close", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "Apex Professional. A coach. An analyst. A deck doctor. A second in your corner.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "I have a coach."},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "Forty minutes away, by ferry, on Saturdays. I read the timetable too.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "You are doing with one tired head what my people do with six rested ones. That is not courage. It is arithmetic, and it is against you."},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "I am not your enemy. I never was. I am the man who saw what you were worth before anybody on that island had looked up.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "On the pier you told me you already had a team. I believed you. Where is it?", "if": "m_no_team", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "On the pier you said you would rather beat my school than join it. You did beat it. Look how many of them came with you.", "if": "m_no_beat", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "On the pier you asked me to wait until you had heard her side. You have heard it. She is not here either.", "if": "m_no_sato", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "And take off the jacket. I say it kindly. It belongs to a school. You have graduated.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "He is being kind. He is always being kind. That is how you find the sharp part.", "cam": "close"},
		{"cine": false},
		{"choice": [["The jacket stays on.", "m_pro_jacket"], ["Where is yours, Mister Crane? Your team.", "m_pro_ask"]]},
		{"cine": true},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "Then it will be the last thing you lose in.", "if": "m_pro_jacket", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "That is not a threat. I kept a red one in a drawer for ten years. I know exactly what a jacket weighs.", "if": "m_pro_jacket", "cam": "close"},
		{"wait": 1.4, "if": "m_pro_ask"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "...I had one. It is in a photograph.", "if": "m_pro_ask", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
