		{"s": "bastion", "t": "I ran the model for tonight. Then I closed the file without reading the result. I am told that is called faith. It is extremely uncomfortable.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "leo", "t": "Look! LOOK! The right way up! It took me five weeks and a ruler!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"s": "leo", "t": "And I brought the stands! Paco has the drum! Luz has the flag! Tonight the Sun shouts for the island!", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "irina", "t": "I came to count. Boreal does not cheer. If you win, I will count to one. Slowly.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "irina", "t": "Tova is counting as well. In a notebook. It is a new notebook.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Hey, little light. Big night. You look taller.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I am taller. Tell him it is rude to notice. Tell him thank you.", "do": "stomp"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "I had a sandwich for you. I ate it on the boat. It was a long boat.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "The pot is inside already. Two pots. The League said one. I did not hear them.", "cam": "low", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Where is Nico?", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "Gone since the first ferry. He said he had a thing. He said it quietly. You know what it means when that one says a thing quietly.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "I told you that a kitchen is a thing you can build. I did not tell you it could cross the water. I did not know.", "cam": "close"},
