			"vo": ["nico", "Good evening. This is the Pro League. I have waited my whole life to say that into something that was plugged in."]},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Tonight, the title. On one side of the floor: forty-one defenses and an empty bench. On the other: a blue jacket, a full corner and, I am told, two pots.", "cam": "wide", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "I am calling this one from the corner. The League said that was irregular. I said: so am I. They ran the cable.", "if": "m_second_nico", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "The League hired a voice for tonight. They did not ask where I was from. I told them anyway. Twice.", "unless": "m_second_nico", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Plugged in. Listen to him. He is not even shouting. He does not have to anymore.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "In the challenger's corner: last one off a ferry. Red by lunch. Then the bench. Then the captaincy. And tonight, one duel from the top of everything.", "cam": "low", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And the champion. Vera Lux. The Undefeated. Forty-one times somebody has stood where the challenger stands. Forty-one times there was nothing more to say.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Posture! The whole League is watching! ...Not that I mind how this one stands.", "do": "stomp"},
		{"s": "sheppard", "t": "Sit down, Doctor.", "cam": "close"},
		{"roster": {"title": "The Pro League", "sub": "The title match", "rows": [["Title", "vera"], ["Challenger", "player"]]}},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "The last line of my card. From the pier. You may have it now.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "It was never a number. It says: alone, do not ask me. With a corner, ask me again.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "I am asking."},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "I know. I am not going to answer. For once I want to find out the slow way, with everybody else.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "One person's part. Yours. We are holding the rest.", "if": "m_second_alexis", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "Things we are going to be right about. There is one line left on the page. I have the pen out.", "if": "m_second_octavia", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "zane", "t": "I have nothing to tell you. I checked. It is a strange feeling. It is a good one.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "And the chair?"},
		{"s": "zane", "t": "I carried it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "She is the best thing I ever made, Elena.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "She is, Silas. Now look at her bench.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "Good evening. Forgive the wait. They insist on the lights.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "Forty-one title defenses. I stopped keeping the trophies after the ninth.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "Mister Crane built the school that built me. He told me I would never need anybody. He was right. I never have.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "They tell me you spent two Saturdays with nobody in your corner. I have spent eleven years. I am told it is not the same thing.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Her bench is empty. Not one coat on it. I know that bench. I sat on it for a whole Saturday.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "Show me the island. Everybody who comes from one says it made them.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "It is behind me. All of it."},
		{"s": "vera", "t": "I see a crowd. I have had crowds. Let us find out if it is anything else.", "cam": "close"},
