		{"s": "vera", "t": "Mister Crane. You said I would never need anybody. I believed you for eleven years. I do not think you ever believed it yourself.", "cam": "low"},
		# ---- the row behind the benches
		{"s": "crane", "t": "I bought the best of everything, Elena. Twice now it has lost to a kitchen.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "It did not lose to a kitchen, Silas. It lost to the people who would not leave one.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "That duelist asked me, in an empty stadium, where my team was. I said: in a photograph. I have thought of little else since.", "if": "m_pro_ask", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "I told that duelist to take the jacket off. Tonight I am glad to be so rarely obeyed.", "if": "m_pro_jacket", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "You were Red once. Second bunk from the door. You complained about the roof every night for three years.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Come and teach, Silas.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "You asked me once if I still wanted him to come. Watch.", "if": "m_ch19_him", "cam": "low"},
		{"wait": 1.8},
		{"s": "crane", "t": "...Is the roof still leaking?", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "It was the first thing we did not fix.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "He did not say yes. He asked about a roof. I think, in his language, that was yes.", "cam": "close"},
