		{"s": "sheppard", "t": "You examined this duelist three times, Doctor. Each time you did your best to make it the last.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "And look how it worked.", "cam": "close", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "sheppard", "t": "He is crying, by the way.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "It is the lights. This stadium is a disgrace. I shall be writing to somebody.", "do": "stomp"},
		{"s": "dorothy", "t": "The shop stays shut tomorrow as well, dears. Nobody on that island is going to be awake.", "do": "wave"},
		{"s": "chazz", "t": "The Chazz knew. The Chazz lost to this three times on purpose, to prepare it. Nobody thanks the Chazz.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "bastion", "t": "I have opened the file. The model said no. I have never been so pleased to be wrong to four decimal places.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "From the corner! I called a title match from the corner of the one who won it! Nobody take this cable away from me!", "if": "m_second_nico", "do": "cheer"},
