		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I am looking for somewhere to stand, and every place near you is taken. I counted. I thought I would mind.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You told a professional you were not alone, when there was only me. Look around. I think I was only the first of them.", "if": "m_ch25_said", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You looked at me once, when a professional said you had nobody. Look around now. I think I was only the first of them.", "if": "m_ch25_look", "cam": "close"},
