		{"s": "lumen", "t": "A year. Same pier. Same boards. Same gull, I think. It is looking at you as if you owe it a commentary.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		# ---- your person: Alexis
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "I said I would be on the pier. I have been here since the light changed. I am not telling you how long that is.", "if": "m_fest_alexis", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "A year of your Saturdays on the screen in the Blue hall. I shouted at it. Ask anybody. No. Do not ask anybody.", "if": "m_fest_alexis", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "I have first chair on the team now. The first thing I did was find a bigger table. You know where I got that.", "if": "m_fest_alexis"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You look like somebody who wins at home.", "if": "m_fest_alexis"},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "And you look like somebody with a full corner. Give me your hand. There. I only wanted to be sure it was really you off that boat.", "if": "m_fest_alexis", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		# ---- your person: Octavia
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "I graduated in spring. I took the earlier boat today so that I would be standing here first. It was on the list.", "if": "m_fest_octavia", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "The council voted to keep my old list on the wall. Framed. I objected. I lost, eleven to one. I was the one.", "if": "m_fest_octavia", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "I work for the League office now. I read rules for a living. They are very badly written. I have never been happier.", "if": "m_fest_octavia"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You said nine o'clock, once. On this pier.", "if": "m_fest_octavia"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "That was a schedule. This is not. I would like the record corrected. Your hand, please. ...Thank you. That is in no rulebook. I looked.", "if": "m_fest_octavia", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		# ---- your person: Jaden
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Hey. You made it. I have been here since yesterday. I fell asleep waiting and then it was today. It worked out.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Third year. Still Red. They asked me about Yellow again. I asked if the new roof was still flat. That was the end of the meeting.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Hey, little light. You look... huh. You look like you are packing.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "cam": "close", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I am not packing. Tell him to mind his own grass.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "do": "stomp"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You said you would be here.", "if": "m_fest_jaden"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "I do not say a lot of things I have to remember. I remembered that one. Sit a second. Lean, if you want. The ferry is not for a while.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "cam": "close"},
		# ---- your people: Nico, Mika and Bruno
		{"s": "mika", "t": "Three hundred and sixty-five days. I counted them without wanting there to be fewer. That is new for me.", "unless": "single", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And stepping onto the pier as a guest, with a visitor's pass and everything... no. I am not doing the voice. Come here.", "unless": "single", "do": "cheer"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "A year of city food. I can see it. Sit on the crate. I brought breakfast down. I was not going to make you walk for it.", "unless": "single", "cam": "low", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "He cried at the timetable this morning. The timetable. I have the time written down.", "unless": "single", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "It had your boat on it!", "unless": "single", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You all came down.", "unless": "single"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "We said we would be on the pier. In Red, when you say a thing, you set a plate for it.", "unless": "single", "cam": "close"},
		# ---- the news
		{"actor": "nico", "at": DOCK + Vector3(1.3, 0, -6.4), "face": "player", "from": DOCK + Vector3(0.4, 0, -11.8), "run": true, "if": "single"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Wait! Nobody tell the news without me! I have a real microphone! I have the news written on my hand!", "if": "single", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "I am only a guest now."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "A guest! Red does not have guests. Red has people who are late for dinner. The news. In order.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Red has a new roof. It still leaks in one place. On principle. Tank put the old bucket back under it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Chazz won the Crown. He has mentioned it. He has mentioned it to the gull."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "The prefect graduated. The council framed her list and hung it beside the crest. Nobody is allowed to add a line. Somebody keeps adding a line.", "unless": "m_fest_octavia"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "The old captain is third on the Ladder. He comes to dinner on Sundays. He brings nothing. He does every dish.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Syrus is the Red prefect. Red has a prefect now. He has a whistle. He has never once used it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Bastion left us a model that predicts everything on this island except Jaden. He says that is the model working."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And the cellar under the Old Dorm opens on Thursdays. Nobody knows who has the keys. I was asked not to look at you while I said that.", "if": "circle_keeper"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "The top line of a certain wall still has the same nickname on it. They say nobody is in a hurry.", "unless": "circle_keeper"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Boreal sent a letter after the title. It says: one. That is all. Irina signed it. Tova counted the words."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Morel plays second on the League team. He asked for second. Out loud. Mika has the date.", "if": "dante_back"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Morel captains Apex now. The first thing he did was put a long table in their dining hall. For talking, they say.", "unless": "dante_back"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Vera Lux came over in spring. Only to look, she said. She has been back four times. She peels things.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Leo sends a sign every month. The crest is the right way up on all of them. Doctor Crowler wears the scarf every Saturday. He says it is the wind.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "The Professor did not come down. She says piers are for arrivals and she has a class at nine. She has left a plate out. It has your name on it."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And Red has a new teacher. Very polite. Calls the Professor by her first name. Very bad at cooking. We do not talk about his Tuesday.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "A polite man burning eggs in the Red kitchen. Ten years late, and right on time.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "I call the Pro League on Saturdays now. With a cable. On my days off I call this pier. For free. For the gull. Some things you keep.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I have one blank card left. You asked me once what it was for. I told you to go and eat.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You never said."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I am about to. Watch the boat.", "cam": "close"},
		# ---- the ferry comes in
		{"s": "nico", "t": "There it is! The first-years' ferry! Places, everybody! Look like an island!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"actor": "rookie", "as": "red_student", "at": DOCK + Vector3(0, 0, -2.0), "from": DOCK + Vector3(0, 0, -0.9), "face": "player", "plain": true},
		{"s": "rookie", "t": "Ugh. If the pier stops moving for one second, I will be fine. One second.", "cam": "close", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Oh, I know that color. That is ferry green. Somebody we know was that color once.", "emote": "!"},
		{"move": "nico", "to": DOCK + Vector3(1.4, 0, -3.0), "face": "rookie", "run": true, "wait": true},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "A new face! First year? Perfect. So here is what I know. Three dorms. Red, Yellow and Blue.", "do": "wave"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Blue is the top. Yellow is the middle. And Red is where they put you when the entrance exam goes badly.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "rookie", "t": "Oh. That sounds bad.", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Which is perfect, if you think about it.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Red is the best one. Do not tell the other two.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "rookie", "t": "Who is that, in the blue jacket? Everybody keeps looking over there.", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Nobody. A guest. Late for dinner.", "do": "scratch"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Look how they hold that deck. With both hands, like it might spill. You did that. I remember.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "rookie", "t": "There is a card in my deck I do not remember. It is blank.", "cam": "close", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Blank? Keep it. Blank ones are lucky. I know somebody who won the Pro League starting with one.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "It is not for you. You are full.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "You are leaving."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "I am not going anywhere. I am only starting somebody.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		{"fx": "flash", "at": DOCK + Vector3(0, 0, -2.0)},
		{"wait": 0.8},
		{"s": "rookie", "t": "Did somebody say something?", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "Nope. Nobody. Welcome to the island.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "emote": "♪"},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Is it like you?", "emote": "?"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "A small one. It will not talk for a day or two. I did not either. I was shy. Do not laugh.", "cam": "close", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "player", "t": "Thank you, Lumen."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "You looked twice. On the boat. Nobody had in a very long time. That is the whole story.", "cam": "close", "emote": "♪"},
		# ---- last lines
		{"move": "rookie", "to": DOCK + Vector3(-1.5, 0, -3.2)},
		{"s": "alexis", "t": "They looked straight at you and had no idea who you were. Enjoy it. It lasts about a week.", "if": "m_fest_alexis", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "octavia", "t": "Somebody should say where the main building is. Not us. Finding it is the first thing that will be theirs.", "if": "m_fest_octavia", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "jaden", "t": "That one is going to be fun. You can tell. Off the boat sick, and smiling anyway.", "if": "m_fest_jaden", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "bruno", "t": "Green in the face and still grinning. That one is Red. I will put a plate out.", "unless": "single", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And up the pier, a little unsteady, last one off the boat, with a deck, a bag and a blank card: a first-year! No name yet! Give it a term!", "do": "cheer", "cam": "wide"},
		{"shot": {"on": DOCK + Vector3(0, 0, -3.0), "look_h": 1.2, "ang": [3.6, 4.3], "d": [11.0, 16.0], "h": [3.0, 6.5], "t": 7.0},
			"vo": ["lumen", "There they go. I was starting to think nobody would ever look twice."]},
		{"remember": "story_told"},
		{"credits": ["Atlas Peak Games", "#Yu-Gi-Oh! Crossroads", "Duel Academy", "A fan story in four acts", "", "#Last one in", "{player}", "Lumen", "",
			"#Red never closes", "Nico Paz    Mika Arai    Bruno Salas", "Professor Elena Sato", "",
			"#The team", "Jaden Yuki    Alexis Rhodes    Syrus and Zane Truesdale", "Chazz Princeton    Bastion Misawa    Aster Phoenix", "Octavia Lenz    Dante Morel", "Doctor Crowler    Chancellor Sheppard    Dorothy", "",
			"#Across the water", "Irina Volkova    Leo Brasa    Selene Varga", "Silas Crane", "",
			"#The Ladder", "Bram Okafor    Ines Calder    Dov Arlen    Petra Sorel", "Cassia Thorn    Milo Ardent    Vera Lux", "", "And one first-year, no name yet", "",
			"#Built on", "Duel rules: ocgcore, by Edoardo Lolletti (edo9300)", "Card scripts: Project Ignis", "Game engine: Godot", "",
			"Yu-Gi-Oh! and its characters belong to their owners.", "This is a private fan game, made for the love of the duel.", "", "#Thank you for playing"]},
		{"cine": false},
		{"end": "Epilogue complete", "pay": 0, "wake": DOCK + Vector3(0.2, 0, -6.0),
			"teaser": "The story is told. The island is still yours: its duels, its mission board and your collection are all still here."},
	],
	# ------------------------------------------------------------ classes (Monday to Thursday mornings)
	# One short challenge each, a different one every time you go (CampusClasses). {"class": kind}
	# sets the flag "v<N>" for this time's version; "@class" in a duel is filled in by the class.
	"class_theory": [
		{"scene": CLASS_SCENE, "title": "Duel Theory", "sub": "Doctor Crowler. One field, one turn."},
		{"class": "theory"},
		{"cine": true},
		{"room": LECT + Vector3(0, 0, -3.0), "r": 6.0},
		{"actor": "cls_a", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-3.3, 0, -0.6), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_b", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(2.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_c", "as": "blue_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-2.2, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_d", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.4, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_e", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "crowler", "at": LECT + Vector3(-0.8, 0, -4.9), "face": "player"},
		{"actor": "mika", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.4, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler"},
		{"actor": "gus", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.6, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler"},
		{"actor": "lumen", "at": LECT + Vector3(1.0, 0, 3.4), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Duel Theory. Sit down, stop talking, and nobody touches the chalk.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Today: two monsters and one number. Take from the one, give to the other. If I have to say more than that, I have already said too much.", "if": "v0", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Today: a monster with a strong arm and a soft back. Most of you only ever look at the arm.", "if": "v1", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Today: machines. Everything they have in one turn, and nothing left afterwards. Rather like Mister Moreno before an examination.", "if": "v2", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "gus", "t": "That is fair.", "if": "v2", "emote": "..."},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Today: a card every one of you plays on your own monster. Read it again. Slowly. Both halves of it.", "if": "v3", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Today: half the strength and twice the swings. Arithmetic. Even this dorm can do arithmetic.", "if": "v4", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "The field is set and you get one turn. Solve it at the first attempt and I write three stars beside your name. I do not get to very often.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "Three stars! I want three stars. I am not even on his list."},
		{"cine": false},
		{"goal": "Take your seat", "at": LECT + Vector3(0.4, 0, -0.9), "r": 1.5, "how": "One field, already set. One turn to win it."},
		{"duel": {"opponent": "crowler", "puzzle": "@class", "class": "theory", "field": "academy", "lose_ok": true,
			"rule": "Duel Theory. The field is set: win this turn."}},
		{"scene": CLASS_SCENE},
		{"cine": true},
		{"room": LECT + Vector3(0, 0, -3.0), "r": 6.0},
		{"actor": "cls_a", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-3.3, 0, -0.6), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_b", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(2.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_c", "as": "blue_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-2.2, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_d", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.4, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "cls_e", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true},
		{"actor": "crowler", "at": LECT + Vector3(-0.8, 0, -4.9), "face": "player"},
		{"actor": "mika", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.4, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler"},
		{"actor": "gus", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.6, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler"},
		{"actor": "lumen", "at": LECT + Vector3(1.0, 0, 3.4), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"flag": "solved", "if": "won"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Correct. At the first attempt. I shall need a moment.", "if": "solved", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "mika", "t": "He is actually writing the three stars. I have never seen him write the third one.", "if": "solved"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Incorrect. Look at the field again. All of it, not only the part you like. Then once more.", "unless": "solved", "cam": "close"},
		{"flag": "second", "unless": "solved"},
		{"cine": false, "unless": "solved"},
		{"duel": {"opponent": "crowler", "puzzle": "@class", "class": "theory", "field": "academy", "lose_ok": true,
			"rule": "Duel Theory, second attempt. The field is set: win this turn."}, "unless": "solved"},
		{"scene": CLASS_SCENE, "if": "second"},
		{"cine": true, "if": "second"},
		{"room": LECT + Vector3(0, 0, -3.0), "r": 6.0, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "cls_a", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-3.3, 0, -0.6), "face": PI, "sit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "cls_b", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(2.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "cls_c", "as": "blue_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-2.2, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "cls_d", "as": "red_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.4, 0, 2.4), "face": PI, "sit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "cls_e", "as": "yellow_student", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.6, 0, 0.9), "face": PI, "sit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "crowler", "at": LECT + Vector3(-0.8, 0, -4.9), "face": "player", "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "mika", "at": LECT + Vector3(-4.4, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler", "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "gus", "at": LECT + Vector3(4.6, 0, -2.4), "face": "crowler", "if": "second"},
		{"actor": "lumen", "at": LECT + Vector3(1.0, 0, 3.4), "face": "player", "spirit": true, "if": "second"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Correct, at the second attempt. Two stars. The first star is for arriving.", "if": "second", "unless": "lost", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "No. The answer is on the board. Copy it down, and next week read every card before you play the first one.", "if": "lost", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "gus", "t": "I got one star too. We can be one star together.", "if": "lost"},
		{"s": "crowler", "t": "Class dismissed. Leave the chalk.", "do": "chat"},
		{"class_end": "theory"},
	],
