		{"actor": "lumen", "at": LECT + Vector3(1.0, 0, 3.4), "face": "player", "spirit": true},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Practice. No chalk today. Find a partner, find a field.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Today's condition: win without a single direct attack. If their field is empty, you wait, or you find another way. Winning is easy. Winning the way you said you would is the job.", "if": "v0", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Today's condition: you start at one thousand Life Points. Your partner starts at four thousand. I want to see how you play when one mistake is all you have.", "if": "v1", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Today's condition: three monsters onto your field in a single turn. Normal Summon, Special Summons, I do not care how. Then win. A deck that does one thing a turn is a deck somebody else is steering.", "if": "v2", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "sato", "t": "Win and meet the condition: three stars. Win without it: two. Lose: one, and you come back next week. I do not keep a list. Crowler keeps the list.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "gus", "t": "I got picked as the partner again. I think it is because I never complain."},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "One condition and one partner. I like this class. Nobody yells."},
		{"cine": false},
